<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 813)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The manual&#8217;s figures are shot in the right colour.</b> The previous set decoded Rec.709 masters as sRGB &#8212; the wrong transform, in a manual about colour management. They are reshot from a graded Rec.709 delivery, with the ACEScg EXR versions of a shot for the compare figures, each read as what it actually is.</li>
</ul>
